# Ignore every file in this folder
*
# Except these
!.gitignore
!_enter
!packages.txt
!debian_snapshot
!kmscon.env
!overlay
!overlay/**
# The fleet's authorised PUBLIC keys (SSH_AUTHORIZED_KEYS). Tracked on purpose:
# which key can log into the fleet is part of the image definition, and an
# untracked one means another builder silently produces a keyless image — which
# is not merely inconvenient, it makes every device that image builds invisible
# to flash-nmap.sh's ownership gate. Public halves only; the private key lives
# on the build host (~/.ssh/junkyard-fleet) and must never land here.
!authorized_keys
# ...but not the cross-compiled tool binaries the .build_pixel_* Make targets
# drop in (re-ignore them; source-of-truth is each tools/pixel-* submodule).
# Must come after !overlay/** to win.
overlay/usr/local/bin/pixel-bootctl
overlay/usr/local/bin/pixel-ota